<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>系统增强</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>相机增强</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，相机 App 顶部「实况」图标左侧会出现一个双摄按钮，点击即可同时调用前后摄像头拍摄，前后两张照片分别存入相册。关闭时该按钮不会出现，相机进程也不会加载双摄组件。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>相机双摄</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn.preferences</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DualCamEnabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>erIcon</key>
			<string>camera.on.rectangle</string>
			<key>erIconSymbols</key>
			<array>
				<string>camera.on.rectangle</string>
				<string>rectangle.on.rectangle</string>
				<string>square.on.square</string>
				<string>camera.fill</string>
			</array>
			<key>erIconColor</key>
			<string>green</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn/ReloadPrefs</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，长按主屏幕上的任意图标，快捷菜单顶部会出现一行「添加到文件夹」：点选手机上已有的文件夹即可把该图标移入。下面的名称设置决定这一行显示的文字。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>快速添加</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn.preferences</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>QuickAdd.Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>erIcon</key>
			<string>folder.badge.plus</string>
			<key>erIconSymbols</key>
			<array>
				<string>folder.badge.plus</string>
				<string>folder.fill.badge.plus</string>
				<string>folder</string>
				<string>plus.circle.fill</string>
			</array>
			<key>erIconColor</key>
			<string>teal</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn/ReloadPrefs</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>名称设置</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn.preferences</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>QuickAdd.ActionName</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>添加到文件夹</string>
			<key>erIcon</key>
			<string>pencil</string>
			<key>erIconSymbols</key>
			<array>
				<string>pencil</string>
				<string>square.and.pencil</string>
			</array>
			<key>erIconColor</key>
			<string>teal</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.strive.echoreborn/ReloadPrefs</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
